# Class quality

Write classes in canonical Tailwind v4 form. After edits: `npm run lint`.

## Before finishing UI edits

Treat IDE `suggestCanonicalClasses` hints as mandatory - apply the suggested form in the same change.

Scan new/changed `className` strings for these slips:

- `z-[300]` / `z-[2]` → `z-300` / `z-2` (integer z-index never uses brackets)
- `left-*` / `right-*` / `ml-*` / `mr-*` → `inset-s-*` / `inset-e-*` / `ms-*` / `me-*`
- `start-*` / `end-*` (position) → `inset-s-*` / `inset-e-*` (e.g. `focus:start-4` → `focus:inset-s-4`)
- `text-left` / `text-right` → `text-start` / `text-end`
- Focus ring: `outline-2 outline-offset-2` (no custom `--spacing-focus-ring-*` tokens)
- Animating `translate-*` / `-translate-y-*`: transition `translate`, not `transform` (Tailwind v4 separate CSS property)
- Named-scale negatives: `outline-offset-[-2px]` / `z-[-10]` → `-outline-offset-2` / `-z-10` (leading `-`)
- Arbitrary negatives: `-inset-[35%]` / `-top-[5%]` → `inset-[-35%]` / `top-[-5%]` (minus **inside** `[…]`, never leading `-` on arbitrary)
- `h-[100px]` / `rotate-[18deg]` / `bg-gradient-to-*` → `h-25` / `rotate-18` / `bg-linear-to-*`
- Content rails: `max-w-[96rem]` / `max-w-[112rem]` → `max-w-384` / `max-w-448` (`rem × 4` = scale step)
- Summed rem calcs that resolve to a scale step: `top-[calc(3.625rem+1rem)]` → `top-18.5` (keep `calc()` only when mixed units, e.g. `100svh-7.25rem`)
- Radial overlays: `bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_…)]` → `bg-radial-[at_…] from-* to-transparent to-<%>` ([background-image](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/background-image)); prefer brand colors (`from-neutral-900/42`) over raw `rgba(…)`

## Correctness

- Only known DS utilities - no typos like `items-cetner`.
- No conflicting classes on the same element (e.g. `block flex`).
- No duplicate classes.
- No redundant variants (e.g. `flex hover:flex`).
- **Outline**: never pair bare `outline` with `outline-*` width (cssConflict). Use `outline-2` (plus color / offset) - not `outline outline-2` / `focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2`.

## Canonical form (Tailwind v4)

Prefer **named utilities** from theme over `[...]` when Tailwind / `suggestCanonicalClasses` offers them:

- `grow` not `flex-grow`; `bg-linear-to-r` not `bg-gradient-to-r`.
- `m-0` not `-m-0`; **`size-*` when width and height match** - `size-12` not `h-12 w-12`, `size-full` not `h-full w-full`, `min-size-12` not `min-h-12 min-w-12`, `max-size-full` not `max-h-full max-w-full` (same for variants: `md:size-16`).
- `gap-8` not `gap-x-8 gap-y-8` when values are equal.
- `rotate-18` not `rotate-[18deg]`; `-rotate-18` not `rotate-[-18deg]`.
- **Spacing scale over arbitrary lengths** (default `--spacing` = 0.25rem): use `h-<number>` / `max-w-<number>` / `w-<number>` / `top-<number>` etc. - never `h-[52px]`, never `max-w-[26.5rem]` when `max-w-106` works, never `max-w-[96rem]` when `max-w-384` works, never `top-[calc(3.625rem+1rem)]` when `top-18.5` works (`rem × 4` = scale step; `suggestCanonicalClasses`). Fractions OK: `min-h-14.5`, `max-w-162.5`, `top-18.5`. Keep `[…]` only for real expressions with mixed units or functions (`min-h-[min(26.25rem,38vw)]`, `w-[clamp(13.75rem,…,20rem)]`, `h-[calc(100svh-7.25rem)]`, `w-[min(…,96rem)]`).
- **`rem` not `px` when an arbitrary length is unavoidable** - `w-[clamp(13.75rem,…,20rem)]` not `w-[clamp(220px,…,320px)]`. Prefer named type utilities when they match (`text-lg` not `text-[18px]` / `text-[1.125rem]`). OK to keep `px` only for true hairlines (`1px` stroke, `translate-y-px`, box-shadow blur in `@theme` tokens).
- **Negatives** (`suggestCanonicalClasses`):
  - **Named scale** → leading `-`: `-outline-offset-2` not `outline-offset-[-2px]`; `-rotate-18` not `rotate-[-18deg]`; `-z-10` not `z-[-10]`; `-top-1.25` not `top-[-0.3125rem]`.
  - **Arbitrary `[…]`** → minus inside brackets: `inset-[-35%]` / `top-[-5%]` not `-inset-[35%]` / `-top-[5%]` (IntelliSense flags the leading-`-` form on arbitrary values).
- Important as **suffix**: `flex!`, `hover:text-white!` - not `!flex`.
- Prefer a named utility / variant when it exists (`not-first:` not `[&:not(:first-child)]:`, `scale-120` not `[transform:scale(…)]`, `scrollbar-none` not `[scrollbar-width:…]`).
- **Aspect ratio**: `aspect-16/10`, `aspect-4/3` - not `aspect-[16/10]` / `aspect-[4/3]` (`suggestCanonicalClasses`).
- **Motion tokens**: `ease-luxury` not `ease-[cubic-bezier(0.25,0.1,0.25,1)]`; `duration-fast` / `duration-base` / `duration-slow` not raw `duration-500` when the brand token matches (see `@theme` in `app.css`).
- **Property arbitrary → utility arbitrary** (`suggestCanonicalClasses`): `filter-[drop-shadow(…)]` not `[filter:drop-shadow(…)]`; `bg-[color-mix(…)]` not `[background:color-mix(…)]`; `touch-[pan-y_pinch-zoom]` not `[touch-action:…]`. Prefer a named utility when it exists (`scale-120` / `scale-100` not `[transform:scale(…)]`; `scrollbar-none` / `scrollbar-thin` not `[scrollbar-width:…]`). Keep `[prop:value]` only for custom properties (`[--lib-header-h:10rem]`) or vendor-only props (`[-webkit-text-stroke:…]`, `[-ms-overflow-style:none]`).
- **z-index**: `z-2`, `z-100`, `z-400` - never `z-[2]` / `z-[100]` (see [z-index docs](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/z-index)). Same for variants: `before:-z-10`, not `before:z-[-10]`.
- **`before:` / `after:`**: Tailwind already sets empty `content` when other `before:*` / `after:*` utilities are present. Do **not** add `before:content-['']` or `after:content-['']`. Keep `content-[...]` only when the value is real (e.g. `before:content-['/']`).
- **CSS variables**: never `[var(--token)]` when a theme prop remains - use `(--token)` (e.g. rare remaining tokens). Prefer named utilities over custom focus/spacing aliases:
  - Focus: `outline-2 outline-offset-2` - do **not** invent `--spacing-focus-ring-*`
  - Do **not** invent layout/leading theme tokens (`spacing-gutter`, `leading-heading`, `max-width-content`) - use spacing scale or clamp expressions (`px-[clamp(0.75rem,2.222vw,2.5rem)]`, `leading-[1.1]`, `max-w-384`). Shared clamp strings for JS probes live in `src/lib/layoutTokens.ts`.
  - Keep `[...]` only for real expressions.
- Brand tracking that used to override `tracking-wide`: use `tracking-[0.12em]` (Tailwind's `tracking-wide` is `0.025em`).
- Sticky under concealed header: `header-concealed:` variant (see `app.css`).

Before saving a class with `[...]`, check IDE suggestions / whether a bracket-free shortcut exists.

## Order and syntax

- Official Tailwind sort order: layout → spacing → typography → color → misc.
- Consistent variant order: `hover:dark:` not `dark:hover:` (per project convention).
- Shorthand: `m-2` not `mt-2 mr-2 mb-2 ml-2`.
- Single space between classes; no trailing spaces.

## Direction (logical, canonical)

Prefer logical inline properties in Tailwind v4 canonical form:

- `inset-s-*` / `inset-e-*` - not `start-*`, `end-*`, `left-*`, `right-*` for inline axis
  - e.g. `focus:inset-s-4`, `inset-s-5`, `inset-s-1/2`
- **Same value on both inline sides → `inset-x-*`** (never write `left-4 right-4`, `inset-s-0 inset-e-0`, `px` already covers padding):
  - `inset-x-0` not `left-0 right-0` / `inset-s-0 inset-e-0`
- `ms-*` / `me-*` / `ps-*` / `pe-*` instead of `ml-*` / `mr-*` / `pl-*` / `pr-*`
- `border-s-*` / `border-e-*` instead of `border-l-*` / `border-r-*` (e.g. `border-s-2 border-s-gold-500`)
- `rounded-s-*` / `rounded-e-*` / `rounded-ss|se|es|ee-*` instead of `rounded-l|r|tl|tr|bl|br-*`
- `text-start` / `text-end` instead of `text-left` / `text-right`
- `origin-start` instead of `origin-left`

## Complexity limits

- Target: ≤20 classes per element. When exceeded - extract a child element or a `*ClassName.ts` helper.
- Do not add classes “just in case”; each must change something.

## Examples

Do **not** paste anti-patterns into a `className="..."` fence in this file - Tailwind IntelliSense will flag them. List slips as prose pairs; show only the canonical form in code:

| Slip | Canonical |
| --- | --- |
| `left-0 right-0` | `inset-x-0` |
| `z-[2]` | `z-2` |
| `rotate-[18deg]` | `rotate-18` |
| `focus:start-4` | `focus:inset-s-4` |
| `h-[100px]` | `h-25` |
| `max-w-[96rem]` / `max-w-[112rem]` | `max-w-384` / `max-w-448` |
| `top-[calc(3.625rem+1rem)]` | `top-18.5` |
| `bg-[#2c2c2c]` | `bg-neutral-800` |
| `outline-offset-[var(--spacing-focus-ring-offset)]` | `outline-offset-2` |
| `before:content-['']` | omit (auto when other `before:*` exist) |
| `bg-gradient-to-r` | `bg-linear-to-r` |
| `bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_120%,…)]` | `bg-radial-[at_50%_120%] from-neutral-900/42 to-transparent to-55%` |
| `-inset-[35%]` / `-top-[5%]` | `inset-[-35%]` / `top-[-5%]` |
| `outline-offset-[-2px]` | `-outline-offset-2` |

```tsx
<div className="absolute inset-x-0 z-2 rotate-18 focus:inset-s-4 h-25 bg-neutral-800 outline-2 outline-offset-2 before:absolute before:inset-0" />
```
